{4}{[She smiles darkly.]  So, King of the Dwarves...you assume that all Dark Elves are the same?  That a name determines what is in one's heart?  Tell me, Loghaire...have you so soon forgotten Lorek the Abjurer? }{[She smiles darkly.]  So, King of the Dwarves...you assume that all Dark Elves are the same?  That a name determines what is in one's heart?  Tell me, Loghaire...have you so soon forgotten Lorek the Abjurer? }{}{2}{}{}
